{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the glowing universe of <strong>Ghlobot Shift</strong> in this free demo! Experience a slice of the full adventure as you guide the Ghlobots across handcrafted levels filled with vibrant worlds, hidden stars, and glowing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you\u2019ll:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a selection of levels from the main game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden dimensional stars </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the charming, glowing atmosphere of the Ghlobot universe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game will feature <strong>35 handcrafted levels</strong>, <strong>7 unique bosses</strong>, and <strong>7 dazzling universes</strong> to explore. But for now, this demo is your first chance to reclaim the Ghlobots\u2019 stolen light and face the darkness that threatens their Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover every hidden star and rise to the challenge?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979470?t=1756303402","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979470/ab620b90a277d5a9a44d9e6e49954708dd34f8cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756303402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979470/0417333f3d8f5d1e17ab61460cbd9a3add7b216a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756303402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979470/0417333f3d8f5d1e17ab61460cbd9a3add7b216a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756303402","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the glowing universe of <strong>Ghlobot Shift</strong> in this free demo! Experience a slice of the full adventure as you guide the Ghlobots across handcrafted levels filled with vibrant worlds, hidden stars, and glowing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you\u2019ll:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a selection of levels from the main game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden dimensional stars </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the charming, glowing atmosphere of the Ghlobot universe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game will feature <strong>35 handcrafted levels</strong>, <strong>7 unique bosses</strong>, and <strong>7 dazzling universes</strong> to explore. But for now, this demo is your first chance to reclaim the Ghlobots\u2019 stolen light and face the darkness that threatens their Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover every hidden star and rise to the challenge?</p>","developers":["DonPianta55"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3978750","name":"Ghlobot Shift"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979470/51b4ec4f91a3ce2135c5f9c3de253d4348afd4b1/header.jpg?t=1756303402","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257187209,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187209/movie480.mp4?t=1756303173","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187209/movie_max.mp4?t=1756303173"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257187209/79114deb70c6746b238eea245b8bab55dc532256/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756303173","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187209/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756303173","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers